Presentation files served by GitHub Pages at /cbom/assets/presentations/.

Drop a deck here and reference it from docs/_data/presentations.yml with
`file: <name>`. Keep the filename lowercase, hyphenated and dated, e.g.
2026-09-16-profile-conformance.pdf. See CONTRIBUTING-meetings.md.

A deck hosted elsewhere does not go here — give the entry a `url:` instead.
